  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: f3c5949bf21646347b625dba2c8c6247, type: 3}
  m_Name: Radio_Tutorial_HeavyArmour
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: PolishTanks.Runtime::PolishTanks.Radio.RadioSequence
  messages:
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a2493e43749f7c8498b1075316e035e8, type: 2}
    text: See that? Your shells can't get through. A tank is always strongest at the front, weaker on the sides, and softest at the back where the engine sits.
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a2493e43749f7c8498b1075316e035e8, type: 2}
    text: Drive around this colossus and put a few rounds up its backside. You'll see a lovely engine fire.
